+// Bind, Snare and Entangle do no damage: the freeze IS the spell, so casting one at a target that
+// is already held has nothing to do and is refused - "Your target is already held by a magical
+// force", which the OSRS wiki's Snare page quotes as the real message.
+//
+// The ancient ice spells are not that. Ice Barrage does 30 and keeping it on a frozen target is
